Bad power supply. I've had half a dozen of these fail like this recently. A
new power supply is about half the price of a 'new' DS700.

I'm on vacation the next 1.5 weeks, and don't remember the part number for
the PS, but it's printed on the thing. Should be an H class number. A web
search on that number should find several sources. I do recommend you buy
new/reconditioned, rather than used, as the originals seem to be reaching
their end of life.


